      "content": "The feeling of being adrift in a universe without meaning can be crushing. The absence of a perceived foundation can make it difficult to cling to anything, leaving you feeling truly isolated and disconnected. In moments like these, emotional pain can be intense, as it feels like the entire ecosystem of your world has collapsed. Allow yourself to simply feel this overwhelming space, without the pressure of finding a way to resolve or overcome it just yet.",
      "source": "target",
