      "content": "\"just feeling it\" doesn't change the fact that nothing is real anymore. if the whole foundation was a lie, then everything i've done was for nothing. it's like the logic says there's no reason to actually stay in this void. if there's no meaning to be found, why am i even forced to keep pretending there is? it just feels so heavy and pointless.",
